#. key: f284cd
msgid ""
"How could a nimib page be read in more than one language? This page looks at how gettext,\n"
"Fluent, Sphinx, mdBook, Quarto, Hugo and others do it, sketches three ways nimib could, and\n"
"tries the best two in a small library, **lingua**. The page is its own example: the switch at\n"
"the top shows it in Italian, from a catalog that lingua keeps up to date."
msgstr ""

#. key: 12f183
msgid ""
"The Italian text was translated by Claude and nobody has reviewed it yet: the catalog marks\n"
"every entry `machine` until someone does. Claude's choices, its conventions and every message\n"
"side by side are in the [translation notes](notes-it.html), the page to review. A chunk with no\n"
"translation shows in English, set apart by a dashed rule."
msgstr ""

